  "slug": "apartment-move-in-condition-checklist-form",
  "title": "Apartment Move-In Condition and Handover Record",
  "subtitle": "Create a shared, evidence-linked baseline for apartment condition, utilities, access devices, unresolved items, resident comments, corrective work, and handover closeout.",
  "description": "A room-by-room apartment move-in condition record covering unit and lease identity, inspection participation, photo references, fixtures and finishes, utility readings, keys and devices, pre-existing concerns, corrective work, exceptions, and accountable acknowledgment.",
  "use_case": "Use during apartment turnover and resident handover to document observable condition without legal conclusions, distinguish pre-existing items from new work requests, assign corrections, and preserve a reviewable baseline for later operations.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
